-- Career skill budgets --------------------------------------------------------

None of the CAREER_* timing variables are read from the environment. The career
skills take them from the skill configuration handed to them at run time
(ctx.config, injected from the manifest as __skill_config), and the career tool
only lists readsEnvironment as metadata that nothing consumes. Setting them in
.env has no effect; change the manifest instead.

CAREER_DELEGATED_TIMEOUT_MS      (in .env.example, never read)
CAREER_BRAIN_FALLBACK_TIMEOUT_MS (in .env.example, never read)
CAREER_BATTLECARD_BUDGET_MS      (in .env.example, never read)
CAREER_MOCK_INTERVIEW_BUDGET_MS  (in .env.example, never read)
CAREER_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS        (never read)
CAREER_REQUEST_RETRIES           (never read)
CAREER_REQUEST_RETRY_BASE_MS     (never read)
CAREER_REQUEST_RETRY_MAX_MS      (never read)
CAREER_PER_SOURCE_CONCURRENCY    (never read)
CAREER_INTER_REQUEST_DELAY_MS    (never read)

-- Mail ------------------------------------------------------------------------

SMTP_HOST=  [not in .env.example]
SMTP_PORT=  [not in .env.example]
SMTP_USER=  [not in .env.example]
SMTP_PASS=  [not in .env.example]
SMTP_FROM=  [not in .env.example]

-- Skill-specific endpoints ----------------------------------------------------

Every variable below is read by a single skill and left empty by default. Set
only the skills you intend to run; a skill without its endpoint reports the
dependency as unavailable instead of failing the mission.

FINANCE_API_KEY, FINANCE_RISK_ENDPOINT
INVESTMENT_MARKET_DATA_API_KEY, INVESTMENT_MARKET_DATA_ENDPOINT
HR_RECRUITING_API_KEY, HR_RECRUITING_ENDPOINT, HR_SCREENING_ENDPOINT
HEALTHCARE_INTAKE_ACCESS_TOKEN, HEALTHCARE_INTAKE_ENDPOINT,
  HEALTHCARE_INTAKE_TOKEN
RESTAURANT_RESERVATION_ENDPOINT, RESTAURANT_SUPPLY_ENDPOINT
SCRIPTWRITING_SUBMISSION_API_KEY, SCRIPTWRITING_SUBMISSION_ENDPOINT
SONGWRITING_DISPATCH_API_KEY, SONGWRITING_DISPATCH_ENDPOINT
SPORTS_PERFORM_API, SPORTS_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS
WEARABLE_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT
OPTA_API_URL, ODDS_DATA_API_URL
ANALYTICS_WAREHOUSE_API_KEY, ANALYTICS_WAREHOUSE_CONFIG,
  ANALYTICS_WAREHOUSE_ENDPOINT
ANALYTICS_METRICS_PATH

  (All [not in .env.example].)

Test-only variables, read by code paths that are not reachable in the
containers: AUTH_TEST_TOKEN, OVERRIDE_TEST_TOKEN, TEST_API_KEY,
TEST_API_TOKEN, TEST_PROPAGATE_KEY, TEST_PROPAGATE_TOKEN, TESTPROV_API_KEY,
TESTPROV_API_URL, TESTPROV_LIST_MODELS_PATH, NOCOLLECTION_API_URL, NOURL_API_KEY,
LLM7_API_KEY, LLM7_API_NAME, LLM7_API_URL, CAREER_TEST_FETCH_LOG,
CAREER_TEST_FETCH_ROUTES.

