/services/auth  (host 4300, container 4300)
================================================================================

PORT=4300

MONGO_URI=mongodb://mongo:27017
MONGO_DB=stage7
  User and token store. In-memory only when MONGO_URI is unset.

ADMIN_EMAIL=  [not in .env.example, default admin@example.com]
ADMIN_PASSWORD=  [not in .env.example, default change-me-in-production]
ADMIN_TENANT=  [not in .env.example, default tenant-1]
  Seed administrator created on first boot when no user with that email
  exists. The default password is public; set both before exposing the stack.

================================================================================
/services/frontend (frontend-nextgen)
================================================================================

No environment variables. The image is a static Vite build served by nginx,
which proxies /api and /ws to http://gateway:3000 on the mcs_network network
(frontend-nextgen/nginx.conf). There is no REACT_APP_* or VITE_* wiring; the
host port is set in docker-compose.yaml.
